<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Kimberley says finds 3.4 carat diamond.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Kimberley says finds 3.4 carat diamond.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kimberley Diamond Co NL said on Thursday a diamond weighing 3.34 carats was recovered during gravel processing at its Blina project in Western Australia.</p>
<p>The stone is an ochtahedron and is pale gold in colour, the company said.</p>
<p>The find brings to 27 the number of diamonds recovered at the project, weighing a total of 10.3 carats, Kimberley said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
